    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SSEN</h2>At a time when magical powers ruled the world, dark forces approached the kingdom of SSEN.<br>The endless forces of darkness have reduced the entire kingdom to ruins.<br>His beloved princess was also in danger.<br>Please save her from dark forces. And bring back a peaceful and beautiful kingdom again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392790/extras/40eecd3409360ca8176f09287ace67b3.poster.avif?t=1713878794\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392790/extras/40eecd3409360ca8176f09287ace67b3.webm?t=1713878794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392790/extras/40eecd3409360ca8176f09287ace67b3.mp4?t=1713878794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMPLE CONTROLS</h2>  Easy and simple controls and intuitive game design make it easy to use various attacks.<br>Experience spectacular action with simple controls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT VARIOUS ARTIFACTS</h2>  As you face higher-level enemies, you can acquire more new artifacts.<br>Obtain all the artifacts in the game with your awesome abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES OF VARIOUS WEAPONS</h2>  Many upgrades are possible, and each upgrade shows more spectacular changes in effect.<br>Experience new and spectacular weapons through all upgrades.",
